1005 003052  5647          JMP I   CTLCTST         /NO, JUST RETURN
1006 003053  6036          KRBIOT                  /YES, READ IN THE CHARACTER
1007 003054  0156          AND     [177]           /JUST SEVEN-BIT
1008 003055  3013          DCA     INCHAR          /SAVE IT
