1036 003100  1676          TAD I   SCRIBE          /GET MESSAGE POINTER
1037 003101  3356          DCA     SCRPTR          /STASH IT
1038 003102  2276          ISZ     SCRIBE          /BUMP PAST ARGUMENT
1039 003103  1146          TAD     [140]           /INITIALIZE TO LOWER-CASE
1040 003104  3354          DCA     SCRCASE         /**** UPPER-CASE ONLY **** CLA
